      "id": "claim_9c0568efd5294953b066e3d7a9d69f95",
      "statement": "MHFC applies a three-lines-of-defense model: lines of business and Treasury/CIO are first line, Independent Risk Management and Compliance are second line (setting appetite, policies, limits and challenging the first line), and Internal Audit is third line reporting to the Audit Committee.",
